Throw a smoke bomb, blocking everyone's line of sight. The smoke dissipates after [6, 8, 10, 11, 12 (TL1-5; SP 100)] turns.

If a creature inside is victim of fire burns the smoke will consume instantly, replicating the burns on all foes and increasing its duration by [2, 3, 4, 4, 4 (TL1-5; SP 100)] turns.

Duration will increase with your Spellpower.
